{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44495","headline":"诗三百三首 一九二 · 寒山","name":"诗三百三首 一九二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"余见僧繇性希奇，巧妙间生梁朝时。\n道子飘然爲殊特，二公善绘手毫挥。\n逞画图真意气异，龙行鬼走神巍巍。\n饶邈虚空写尘迹，无因画得志公师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寒山","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}